patrone-desktop (0.2.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Patrone's own updates: its apt repository, hosted on GitHub Pages
    (billsecond.github.io/patrone-apt), and its key, so Patrone's packages
    update through Patrone Software and the daily automatic updates like
    Ubuntu's. Its builds of Ubuntu's packages (GDM, GNOME Settings,
    first-login setup) come before Ubuntu's own, even newer ones
    (preferences.d/patrone.pref): Patrone builds each of Ubuntu's updates
    to them again with its changes.

